		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Silvery-skinned monsters that live in the half-world on the other side of mirrors.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 4, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 slam +1 (1d4), <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +1, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> +0, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 1</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Death Throes</strong>. When slain, explodes in near-sized glass shards, cube centered on soulsliver. DEX 12+ or 1d6 damage.</p><p></p><p><strong>Mirror Travel</strong>. Step inside mirror within close. May teleport far to another mirror.</p><p></p><p><strong>Shapechange</strong>. Assume the mirror image shape of a being reflected in the mirror the soulsliver is in.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
